  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nSimple interest = 2808\n\nTime = 3(5)/(9) years\n\nRate = 2.7%\n\nTime = 5(2)/(3) years\n\nRate = 9.2%\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nSI = (P × R × T) ÷ 100\n\nAmount = P + SI\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 3(5)/(9) = 32/9\n\n⇒ 5(2)/(3) = 17/3\n\n⇒ P = (2808 × 100) ÷ (2.7 × 32/9)\n\n⇒ P = 280800 ÷ (86.4/9)\n\n⇒ P = 280800 × 9 ÷ 86.4\n\n⇒ P = 2527200 ÷ 86.4\n\n⇒ P = 29250\n\n⇒ SI = (29250 × 9.2 × 17/3) ÷ 100\n\n⇒ SI = 269100 × 17 ÷ 3 ÷ 100\n\n⇒ SI = 4574700 ÷ 3 ÷ 100\n\n⇒ SI = 1524900 ÷ 100\n\n⇒ SI = 15249\n\n⇒ Amount = 29250 + 15249\n\n⇒ 44499\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 44499.**",
